<title>ARGENTINA: Argentine Central Bank places $18 mln repos.</title>
<headline>Argentine Central Bank places $18 mln repos.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-06-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Argentina's Central Bank said Tuesday it placed $18 million in overnight reverse repos at 9.0 percent.</p>
<p>Call money rose to 5.5 percent from 5.45 percent at close Friday. The U.S. dollar rose to 0.99985 pesos from 0.99942 pesos Friday. Monday was a local holiday.</p>
<p>((--Buenos Aires Newsroom +541 318-0655))</p>
